      "answer": "(1) $-2$ (2) $-\\frac{3}{2}$ (3) $7$ (4) $3x^{2}+14x+3=0$",
      "solution": "(1) $\\alpha+\\beta=-\\frac{4}{2}=-2$\n(2) $\\alpha\\beta=\\frac{-3}{2}=-\\frac{3}{2}$\n(3) $\\alpha^{2}+\\beta^{2}=(\\alpha+\\beta)^{2}-2\\alpha\\beta=4+3=7$\n(4) 두 근의 합 $\\frac{\\beta}{\\alpha}+\\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta}=\\frac{\\alpha^{2}+\\beta^{2}}{\\alpha\\beta}=-\\frac{14}{3}$\n두 근의 곱 $\\frac{\\beta}{\\alpha}\\times\\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta}=1$이고 $x^{2}$의 계수가 $3$인 이차방정식은\n$3\\left(x^{2}+\\frac{14}{3}x+1\\right)=0$\n$3x^{2}+14x+3=0$",
